Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.88-rt126 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.88 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.2-rt
  Head SHA1: ed036322e8ee7cac44f90df13b18f67072bf1fc6


Or to build 3.2.88-rt126 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.88.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.88-rt126.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

